cff-version: 1.2.0
message: Please cite this project using these metadata.
title: "MLogger: A Local Tracker for Machine Learning Training"
abstract: >-
  MLogger is an experiment tracker that runs entirely on the
  user's own machine. It records training metrics, monitors
  GPUs from different vendors and explains the state of a
  training run in plain language: learning, overfitting,
  plateau or divergence. It has no third-party dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - name: MLogger contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/charleemagn/mlogger"
url: "https://github.com/charleemagn/mlogger"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-12"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - experiment tracking
  - training monitoring
  - GPU monitoring
